       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "2": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "stop announcing your plans"
     ],
     "texte": "learn [[photography]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "telling everyone your goals can give you a hit of",
      "dopamine before you've actually done anything"
     ],
     "texte": "light, framing, timing: every shot teaches you to [[see what everyone walks past]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "you get to feel",
      "ambitious, receive",
      "praise, and imagine",
      "the end result",
      "without putting in",
      "the work"
     ],
     "texte": "in one study, older adults who learned photography for 3 months [[improved their memory]] more than those who just socialised"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "stop talking about what you're going to do. disappear,",
      "put your head down, and let your results speak for you"
     ],
     "texte": "no fancy gear needed, your phone is enough to start, the point is [[learning to see]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0a28ab50.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "read books instead of scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "pick up [[a new language]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "a book makes you follow one idea for pages.",
      "scrolling trains that out of your head"
     ],
     "texte": "new words, new grammar: your brain [[switches between two systems]] all day"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "if you want to think",
      "deeper, give your brain",
      "something long before",
      "anything short"
     ],
     "texte": "studies found dementia symptoms showing up [[about 4 years later]] in bilingual people"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i use readup which blocks",
      "my apps until i read for 20",
      "minutes, which stopps me",
      "from scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "today i finally got why the renaissance started in italy, in 5 min on [[the Sophia app]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": "sophia_capture",
    "I2": "sophia_appstore"
